# Everything is LF in the repository.
#
# This is not cosmetic. The dataset is committed from a Linux runner every night and was
# authored from Windows. Without this, the two disagree about line endings and every
# nightly commit rewrites all 6MB of data/domains.jsonl instead of the handful of lines
# that actually changed, which would turn a year of history into gigabytes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The dataset is the product. Mark it so GitHub does not count it as source, and so diffs
# stay line-oriented.
data/*.jsonl linguist-generated=true text eol=lf
data/*.json  linguist-generated=true text eol=lf
